{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dreadnought_mace_held","model_identifier":"dreadnought_mace_held","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## dreadnought_mace_held\n\nThe Dreadnought's heavy spiked two-handed war mace, held (Patch 7). The `mace` group of `heavy_knight` (Jade's model, unchanged) copied cube for cube with its own pixels: same size, shape and colours, no redraw.\n\n- Cubes: 46 (20 of them the 45-degree diagonal spikes, rotated about one axis through the ball centre). Texture 128x128, embedded, heavy_knight's own pixels repacked to the faces used.\n- Held convention, as `obsidian_handaxe_held`: the primary grip (the right fist, heavy_knight's `slot_hand_r` pivot (18, 29.5, 0)) is at the origin and the head points along -Z. In heavy_knight the mace already lay along -Z from that pivot with no rest rotation, so it is only moved by (-18, -29.5, 0), not turned. Placed at `slot_hand_r` of `heavy_knight_body` with no rotation, it sits exactly where it sits on heavy_knight today.\n- Length 54.0 units (152 cm): spike tip at z -36.5, pommel cap at z +17.5. Ball centre 25 units (70 cm) in front of the grip; spikes reach 11.5 units further.\n- Groups: `root` > `mace` (pivot at the origin) and `slot_grip`. Attachment points: `slot_grip` (0, 0, 0), the primary grip; `slot_mace_head` (0, 0, -25) on `mace`, the ball centre (the impact point the attack keys are measured at); `slot_grip_l` (0, 0, 11) on `mace`, where his left hand holds the shaft (heavy_knight's `slot_mace_grip_l`, renamed). heavy_knight_body's clips solve the left hand onto that point.\n- Clip `death` (2.5 s, hold, markers release 0.333 / land 1.583): heavy_knight's own `mace` keys from his `death` clip, moved here unchanged (they animate the `mace` group about the grip, in `slot_hand_r`'s frame): released at 0.333 s, it falls and rests on the ground to his right front. Played in step with heavy_knight_body's `death`, the mace drops exactly as it does on heavy_knight today; nothing else in this file is animated.\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"mace_handle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2,-2,-19],"to":[2,2,14],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[19,120,23,124],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,116,33,120],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[23,120,27,124],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[33,116,66,120],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,0,22,33],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[22,0,26,33],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7a8a5fd0-7fa3-572c-ba3d-4c4033835856"},{"name":"mace_wrap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.25,-2.25,-4.5],"to":[2.25,2.25,14.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[76,100,85,109],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,100,38,109],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[85,100,94,109],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[38,100,76,109],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,9,38],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,18,38],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0b6f3ae4-5975-5106-8124-f102e9483872"},{"name":"mace_pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3,-3,14.5],"to":[3,3,16.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,86,18,98],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[30,86,34,98],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18,86,30,98],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[34,86,38,98],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[66,116,78,120],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[78,116,90,120],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"798513df-29f7-5e52-94c0-78924a5e50de"},{"name":"mace_pommel_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2,-2,16.5],"to":[2,2,17.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[94,100,102,108],"textu