":[{"x":8.5481,"y":52.8252,"z":30.6661}],"uuid":"fb411033-8730-56d5-ad44-b5a3ee91ab77","time":1.4583,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-2.7924,"y":56.4601,"z":22.1232}],"uuid":"953abd9e-e477-53e4-9ad2-1446a67847c6","time":1.4792,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-17.6485,"y":59.1078,"z":10.2911}],"uuid":"6ce0b95e-1efe-5731-8b43-ddad6dc422ef","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-35.104,"y":59.9836,"z":-4.0125}],"uuid":"b2f6bd83-0a6b-52cb-b37e-9d2e29a9c748","time":1.5208,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-52.8123,"y":58.7033,"z":-18.5119}],"uuid":"db7ab48c-83cd-5b7a-8714-0b7b282442a0","time":1.5417,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-68.4329,"y":55.5672,"z":-30.9157}],"uuid":"dfc8657d-133b-539b-a6df-b8d5aa8c4f92","time":1.5625,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-81.0924,"y":51.3263,"z":-40.3817}],"uuid":"7a2cc094-489f-50a4-ba06-bfeebd1b29c9","time":1.5833,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-81.9809,"y":50.4806,"z":-41.5543}],"uuid":"cb112492-59d0-5edf-8a55-439ee8f7ee73","time":1.6042,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-86.4627,"y":47.5032,"z":-45.6821}],"uuid":"e74cc278-9e9b-579a-83e4-5829206ae608","time":1.6667,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-89.0284,"y":45.7962,"z":-48.0238}],"uuid":"e7c84a33-017d-5e54-972c-8c5e519bdea7","time":1.7292,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-90.7424,"y":44.6596,"z":-49.3433}],"uuid":"f08f768e-67c0-5e3f-8f65-ad521b01deca","time":1.8542,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-89.3218,"y":45.4515,"z":-48.4893}],"uuid":"21018897-97c0-57ad-8445-379bdba66e81","time":2.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"## dreadnought_mace_held\n\nTwo-handed weapon, the Dreadnought's heavy spiked mace, held (Patch 7).\n\n- Cubes: 46 (20 rotated). Texture 128x128, 2 px per unit as heavy_knight, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -11.5..11.5, y -11.5..11.5, z -36.5..17.5 (size 23.0 x 23.0 x 54.0 u = 65 x 65 x 152 cm).\nThe Dreadnought's heavy spiked mace: heavy_knight's `mace` group (46 cubes) copied as it is, the same size, shape and colours, turned to the held pattern of `obsidian_handaxe_held`: the grip at the origin, the head along -Z, an empty `slot_grip` at the origin, `slot_mace_head` kept, and `slot_mace_grip_l` renamed `slot_grip_l` (where his left hand holds the shaft, 11 units behind the grip). Placed at `heavy_knight_body`'s `slot_hand_r` it sits exactly where it sits on heavy_knight. Its `death` clip is heavy_knight's own keys for the mace, so it falls with him when played in step with the body's `death`. Patch 7.\n"}